[agent:result] 4	
[agent:result] 5	Build the full pipeline on the platform:
[agent:result] 6	1. Engineer features (weather + lag/rolling air-quality signals) into a feature group `airq3c8c0c`.
[agent:result] 7	2. Assemble a training dataset `airqtd3c8c0c`.
[agent:result] 8	3. Train a PM2.5 regressor and register it as `airqmodel3c8c0c` WITH its evaluation metrics.
[agent:result] 9	4. Predict every row of `forecast_days.csv` into a feature table `airqpred3c8c0c` (record key `date`, column `pm25_pred`).
